-2 \ ? PROPERTIES "OPTION-SETS" SRK ? \ PARAM BASE = SRK \ ? PROPERTIES 
"MOLEC-STRUCT" "ETHAN-01" ? ? PROPERTIES "MOLEC-STRUCT" "PROPA-01" ? ? 
